# Two documents that are authoritative somewhere other than this repo, kept
# out so a local copy cannot drift from the real one and be read as current.
#
# empowered-vote-primer.md now has that home: the ev-primer plugin in
# EmpoweredVote/ev-ui, split into philosophy.md (durable) and
# infrastructure.md (dated, verified 2026-11-05).
#   https://github.com/EmpoweredVote/ev-ui/tree/main/plugins/ev-primer
# The copies in four other repos became pointers on 2026-11-05. This ignore
# is what stands in for a pointer here: the February text that may still be
# sitting in your working tree is wrong about the schema, the default branch
# and the health check, so do not commit it.
#
# 10_Connect_Issues-in-Focus-detailed.md is numbered as part of a series
# maintained elsewhere and still has no single home. For that one, this
# ignore remains the placeholder rather than the decision.
empowered-vote-primer.md
